<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>

<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardHd">What is this?</div>
    <div class="cardBd">
      <p class="muted"><span>PlayCtrl.me is an app built for ADULTS ONLY. You must be 18 years old or older to use it. No exceptions.</span> This is an app heavily inspired by <strong>PlayMyPC</strong>, and allows users to send commands to their friend's PCs through device control links.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardHd">How do I join?</div>
    <div class="cardBd">
      <p class="muted">This app uses <span>discord</span> for accounts, so long as you have a discord account you can login here. However, this site may not always have open enrollment. If that's the case, you'll have to wait for enrollment to open up again.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardHd">How do I get started?</div>
    <div class="cardBd">
      <p class="muted"><strong>1)</strong> Go to your <span>profile</span></p>
      <p class="muted"><strong>2)</strong> <span>Download</span> the client (currently Windows only)</p>
      <p class="muted"><strong>3)</strong> <span>Pair</span> the client using the code on your profile</p>
      <p class="muted"><strong>4)</strong> <span>Share</span> your control page to others</p>
      <br>
      <p class="muted"><strong>4) If you ever have any issues, right click the app inside of your app tray and select "Check for updates"</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardHd">Is there a discord server?</div>
    <div class="cardBd">
      <p class="muted">We currently have a community-ran discord server made by the lovely Axetra!
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://discord.gg/GDKYvcS8RZ">Join the Discord</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardHd">Rules / Terms of Serice</div>
    <div class="cardBd">
      <p class="muted">
        <strong>1) You must be 18 years old or older to use PlayCtrl.me. By using this website you agree to be at least 18 years old, and are legally allowed to use this service wherever you reside.</strong>
        <br><br>
        <strong>2) By proceeding to use this app you understand that anyone with access to your control link can send messages, images, url's, etc. to your device. PlayCtrl.me is not responsible for the actions of its users.</strong>
        <br><br>
        <strong>3) ABSOLUTELY NO ILLEGAL CONTENT IS ALLOWED. We have a zero tolerance policy. If it couldn't pass Discords TOS, don't send it here.</strong><br>
        Some examples include but are not limited to:<br>
        - Any content that could be interpreted as sexual content involving minors (including shota/loli)<br>
        - Any content depicting child exploitation or abuse<br>
        - Any content promoting violence, hate, abuse, harassment, or criminal activity<br>
        <br>
        <strong>4) All interactions on PlayCtrl.me must be between fully consenting adults. If you continue to send content to a user who has asked you to stop, or are seen repeatedly overstepping boundaries, you will be banned.</strong>
        <br><br>
        <strong>5) We may temporarily or permanently ban your account at any time without notice for violating any of our terms.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="cardHd">How can I help?</div>
    <div class="cardBd">
      <img src="/public/gg_queen.png" alt="Art by Rapsik- on ych.commishes.com" style="height: 250px; padding: 18px; float: right;">
      <p class="muted">If you wish to help with moderation, I may end up allowing some people in as site admins to keep this place clean.<br><br>
        If you wish to help with the costs of hosting this service, please feel free to donate to my throne!
      </p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://throne.com/ggthekitty">Donate Here!</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>